    "description": "Lumber camp (sawmill), level 1 of 3: shell and fittings (what soldiers build first). A miniature sawmill (16 x 11): a short open mill shed (dark oak frame on cobblestone feet, oak roof with dark oak eaves and trim) with the saw bench in the middle, a sash-saw frame whose belt drives the blade on the carriage line; the grindstone (workstation). L1 the shed, the saw and plank stacks; L2 a waterwheel on the end and the log yard; L3 a crane over the logs, a drying rack, a sign and saplings.",
    "changes": "Fix: the two lanterns in the shed hung from thin air (they would drop in game); they now hang from the end tie beams. Nothing else changed.",
